      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Compliance Audit Summary: Data Integrity Protocol v4.2 (DIP v4.2)**\n\n**I. Introduction**\n   1. Organization Name \n   2. Objective\n\n**II. Data Encryption (AES-256 at Rest)**\n   1. Description of Encryption Standard\n   2. Compliance Status\n\n**III. Access Logs and Retention Duration**\n   1. Access Logs Policy\n   2. Retention Period\n   3. Compliance Status\n\n**IV. Breach Reporting Procedures**\n   1. Breach Detection and Reporting Process\n   2. Timeframe for Reporting Breaches\n   3. Compliance Status\n\n**V. Periodic Vulnerability Scans**\n   1. Scan Schedule\n   2. Findings and Remediation Actions\n   3. Compliance Status\n\n**VI. Data Processing Agreements (DPAs) with Third-Party Vendors**\n   1. Vendor Compliance Requirements\n   2. Document Availability and Approval\n   3. Compliance Status\n\n**VII. Conclusion**\n   1. Summary of Compliance Status\n   2. Action Plan for Non-Compliant Areas\n   3. Future Audit Recommendations",
      "source": "target",
